title: Couple
---
<<if $ratseen is true>>
<<jump Couple_SeeRat>>
<<endif>>
Woman 1: I know we said we'd be poly, but.. I don't think I can do this.
Woman 2: We haven't even tried. It's been two weeks. 
Woman 1: I just don't think it's fair. 
Woman 1: You want a girlfriend AND a boyfriend, \\n but ever since you started seeing Brad, \\n you haven't come home. 
Woman 1: I made pumpkin soup for you but \\n you'd rather eat Taco Bell with a 5'7” man.
Woman 2: You don't even know Brad!
Woman 1: You haven't introduced us. You asked to be \\n poly, Marcy, and I said yes, for you. 
Woman 1: I haven't been on dating apps, I haven't talked to anyone. 
Woman 1: I've done all of this for you. But what about me? \\n  What about my needs?
Woman 2: Maybe we're not on the same page about this. \\n Brad is fun, but that's it. 
Woman 2: In the quietest hours of the evening, \\n amidst the final rays of the sunset...
Woman 2: I still want to eat pumpkin soup with you. 
Woman 1: ...maybe I don't want to make pumpkin soup anymore...
Woman 2: What?
Woman 1: I'm going to take the C train instead of the A.
Woman 2: Wh- what about the Lesbian Librarians cocktail party? \\n  I don't want to go alone!
Woman 1: Maybe you should've thought of that before \\n getting involved with Brad!

