title: Girlboss
---
<<if $ratseen is true>>
<<jump Girlboss_SeeRat>>
<<endif>>

Girlboss: No, Mark, you're not listening. I needed those YoY ROI investment portfolio earning graphs today.
Girlboss: Don't blame Amber for this. She consistently submits her holding period portfolio stocks graphs and charts on time. 
Girlboss: But you - this is the third time you've been late.
Girlboss: You're on thin ice, Mark. I don't care about your Harvard MBA. 
Girlboss: State school quant graduates are the real hot commodities right now. 
Girlboss: And they don't need to do three lines of coke every day to do their job.
Girlboss: Listen. If you don't get your shit together, your LinkedIn status will change from “employed” to “looking for work.”
Girlboss: You'll get the earning graphs submitted in the next 53 minutes? 
Girlboss: That's what I like to hear. 
Girlboss: You better get started on next week's Earnings per Share market capitalization beta alpha omega documents too. 
Girlboss: Stay overnight if you have to, I don't care. Your wife and kids can wait!

